# Backblaze B2 Cold Storage Architecture

## Overview

Backblaze B2 is the cold storage tier, positioned below Cloudflare R2 (warm) in the storage hierarchy. Both achieve zero egress through the Cloudflare Bandwidth Alliance.

## Storage Hierarchy

| Tier | Provider | Cost/GB/mo | Egress | Use Case |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| Hot | Redis | N/A (memory) | N/A | Active session state, ephemeral |
| Warm | Cloudflare R2 | $0.015 | Free (Cloudflare) | Archived sessions, vault items, active reads |
| Cold | Backblaze B2 | $0.006 | Free (via Cloudflare CNAME) | Long-term archives, WORM compliance |
| Heritage | R2 + B2 + Azure + AWS + NAS | Varies | Varies | Penta-redundant critical data |

